  "executed_contracts": [
    "Exact and exhausted file/count/total/path/session/metadata bounds precede filesystem operations",
    "Actual encoded JSON expansion is bounded; empty payloads are accepted",
    "Unicode scalar UTF-8 validation rejects malformed metadata and filenames; embedded metadata NUL is escaped and payload bytes remain unrestricted",
    "All seven operation callbacks throwing are converted to Internal; the previous successful export remains byte-identical",
    "Cancellation interrupts bounded partial writes and prevents publication after the Publish callback",
    "Cancellation or deadline arriving during the final real directory fsync retracts the completion marker after syscall return",
    "Failed marker retraction sets completionUncertain and remains a failed result even if the marker is visible",
    "Canonical staging aliases and symbolic-link completion markers are rejected",
    "Production pinned SDKCoreGen flat and chunked owned array-subset outputs compile as real host C++ programs",
    "Actual child-process _exit at partial-write, staged, published-directory and visible-marker boundaries preserves previous output and releases the root lock for a subsequent successful publication; visible marker remains a presence-only result",
    "Directory close failures return Io; a failed close during completion-marker retraction sets completionUncertain even when the marker rename succeeded"
  ],
  "unverified": [
